From 089c1203a92ec7820312f04fbdab0c825ce556d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:27:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Allow events with unlimited capacity

A blank capacity is stored as NULL and means unlimited spots. The
CHECK constraint already accepts NULL. availableSpots() returns null
for unlimited events, and the list and show pages print "ilimitadas"
instead of casting NULL to 0.
